## GSD Models Command - Interactive Flow
## 用法: 用 REST Client (VS Code) 或 IntelliJ HTTP Client 执行
## 注意: 这是流程文档，URL 为虚拟的，不可直接执行

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### 0. 初始化数据（命令触发时一次性获取）
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### 0.1 读取当前 GSD 配置
GET /projects/pi-gsd/.planning/config.json

> {%
client.test("config exists", function() {
  var profile = response.body.model_profile;
  var overrides = response.body.model_overrides;
  // 如果 profile === "inherit" 或文件不存在 → tierModels = null
  // 否则从 overrides 反解出 tierModels
});
%}

### 0.2 获取已启用模型列表
GET /api/models/enabled

> {%
client.global.set("enabledModels", JSON.stringify(response.body));
%}

### 0.3 获取所有有认证的模型
GET /api/models/available

> {%
client.global.set("allModels", JSON.stringify(response.body));
%}

### 0.4 取交集：只保留 enabledModels 中的模型
# POST /api/models/filtered
# 如果 enabledModels 为空，fallback 到全量 available

### 0.5 获取 Pi 主会话模型（仅用于 inherit 描述）
GET /api/session-model

> {%
client.global.set("sessionModel", response.body.sessionModel);
%}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### 1. Step 1: 选 Heavy Tier Provider
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### 1.1 选择 Heavy Tier 的 Provider
# 排序: 当前 heavy tier provider 最前，其余 alpha
# 当前配置 heavy = "openai-codex/gpt-5.5" → provider = "openai-codex"

POST /gsd-models/tier/heavy/provider
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentTierModel": "openai-codex/gpt-5.5",
  "providers": [
    { "id": "openai-codex", "modelCount": 3 },
    { "id": "claude-bridge", "modelCount": 2 },
    { "id": "ollama-cloud", "modelCount": 6 }
  ]
}

###

### 1.2 选择 Heavy Tier 的 Model
# 排序: 当前 heavy model 最前，其余 alpha

POST /gsd-models/tier/heavy/model
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "openai-codex",
  "currentTierModel": "openai-codex/gpt-5.5"
}

> {%
client.global.set("heavy", "openai-codex/gpt-5.5");
%}

###


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### 2. Step 2: 选 Standard Tier Provider + Model
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### 2.1 选择 Standard Tier 的 Provider
# 当前配置 standard = "ollama-cloud/glm-5.1" → provider = "ollama-cloud"

POST /gsd-models/tier/standard/provider
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentTierModel": "ollama-cloud/glm-5.1",
  "providers": [
    { "id": "ollama-cloud", "modelCount": 6 },
    { "id": "claude-bridge", "modelCount": 2 },
    { "id": "openai-codex", "modelCount": 3 }
  ]
}

###

### 2.2 选择 Standard Tier 的 Model

POST /gsd-models/tier/standard/model
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "ollama-cloud",
  "currentTierModel": "ollama-cloud/glm-5.1"
}

> {%
client.global.set("standard", "ollama-cloud/glm-5.1");
%}

###


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### 3. Step 3: 选 Light Tier Provider + Model
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### 3.1 选择 Light Tier 的 Provider
# 当前配置 light = "openai-codex/gpt-5.3-codex-spark"

POST /gsd-models/tier/light/provider
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentTierModel": "openai-codex/gpt-5.3-codex-spark",
  "providers": [
    { "id": "openai-codex", "modelCount": 3 },
    { "id": "claude-bridge", "modelCount": 2 },
    { "id": "ollama-cloud", "modelCount": 6 }
  ]
}

###

### 3.2 选择 Light Tier 的 Model

POST /gsd-models/tier/light/model
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "openai-codex",
  "currentTierModel": "openai-codex/gpt-5.3-codex-spark"
}

> {%
client.global.set("light", "openai-codex/gpt-5.3-codex-spark");
%}

###


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### 4. Step 4: 选 Profile
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

POST /gsd-models/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heavy": "openai-codex/gpt-5.5",
  "standard": "ollama-cloud/glm-5.1",
  "light": "openai-codex/gpt-5.3-codex-spark",
  "sessionModel": "ollama-cloud/glm-5.1"
}

> {%
client.global.set("profile", "balanced");
%}

###


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### 5. Step 5: 写入配置
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

PUT /gsd-models/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scope": "project",
  "profile": "balanced",
  "tierModels": {
    "heavy": "openai-codex/gpt-5.5",
    "standard": "ollama-cloud/glm-5.1",
    "light": "openai-codex/gpt-5.3-codex-spark"
  }
}

> {%
client.test("config written", function() {
  client.assert(response.status === 200, "Config write succeeded");
});
%}

###


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### EDGE CASES
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### E1. Config 不存在或 profile=inherit

# GET /.planning/config.json 返回 {} 或 { "model_profile": "inherit" }
# → tierModels = null
# → provider/model 无预选，纯 alpha 排序
# → 标题显示: "Current: inherit (uses Pi session model)"

GET /projects/pi-gsd/.planning/config.json-when-empty

###

### E2. enabledModels 为空

# GET /api/models/enabled 返回 []
# → 不过滤，fallback 全量
# → NOTIFY warning: "No enabledModels filter; showing all configured models"

GET /api/models/enabled-when-empty

###

### E3. 用户取消 (ESC)

# 任何 select 返回 undefined → 立即终止流程，不写入任何配置

###


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### PROFILE 描述生成规则
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

# inherit:  "All agents → (Pi session model)"
# quality:  "All agents → {heavy}"
# balanced: "H={heavy}  S={standard}  L={light}"
# budget:   "H={standard}  S={standard}  L={light}"
# adaptive: "H={heavy}  S={standard}  L={light}"

###


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### PROXY IMPLEMENTATION 映射
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

# "GET config"           → readJsonObject(resolveGsdConfigPath(...))
# "GET enabled"          → readEnabledModels()
# "GET available"        → ctx.modelRegistry.getAvailable()
# "POST filtered"        → available.filter(m => enabledIds.has(`${m.provider}/${m.id}`))
# "GET current-tiers"    → inferTierModelsFromOverrides(config.model_overrides)
# "GET session-model"    → formatModelId(ctx.model)
# "PUT config"           → mergeGsdModelConfig() + writeJsonObject()